  ('meeting-recap', 'Meeting Recap', 'brief', 'Summarize a recent meeting into a brief you can share after review.', 'Use when a meeting ends or a new transcript is available.
Proactively suggest when Capture routes a meeting or Fireflies transcript.', '{"type":"capture","signal":"meeting_ended"}'::jsonb, '# Meeting Recap

## What this does

Reads the meeting transcript, summarizes key decisions and open questions, and saves an internal brief — no external send unless you choose to share it later.

## When it runs

- A meeting just ended
- A new transcript lands from Fireflies or calendar capture

## Steps

1. **Load transcript** — Salt pulls the latest meeting transcript.
2. **Summarize** — Extracts decisions, owners, and open questions in your voice.
3. **Render brief** — Formats a scannable recap you can paste or share after review.

## What you approve

External sharing only if you explicitly approve a follow-up play; this recipe auto-saves the draft brief internally.', '{"version":1,"steps":[{"kind":"fetch","tool":"FIREFLIES_GET_TRANSCRIPT","params":{},"bind":"transcript"},{"kind":"llm","purpose":"meeting_recap","modelSlot":"playPersonalize","instructions":"Summarize this meeting: decisions, open questions, next moves. Bullet format.","inputs":["transcript.title","transcript.summary"],"maxTokens":400,"bind":"recap"},{"kind":"render","template":"# Meeting recap: {{transcript.title}}\n\n{{recap}}","bind":"brief"}],"value":{"kind":"time_saved","amount":15,"currency":"USD","fromGap":false}}'::jsonb, '{}'::text[], '{"kind":"time_saved","amount":15,"currency":"USD","fromGap":false}'::jsonb, 1, 'active'),
  ('overdue-invoice-reminder', 'Overdue Invoice Reminder', 'billing', 'Prepare a polite payment reminder when an invoice is overdue.', 'Use when Stripe shows an overdue invoice tied to a client relationship.
Proactively suggest when Billing Player flags revenue at risk.', '{"type":"pattern","signal":"overdue_invoice","min_days_overdue":7}'::jsonb, '# Overdue Invoice Reminder

## What this does

Pulls the overdue invoice from Stripe, checks that it is past due, and drafts a professional reminder email in Gmail.

## When it runs

- An invoice is 7+ days overdue
- Billing Player or an opportunity gap flags collectible revenue

## Steps

1. **Read invoice** — Salt loads the overdue invoice amount and due date from Stripe.
2. **Confirm overdue** — Skips if the invoice is not actually past due (avoids embarrassing misfires).
3. **Render reminder** — Uses a consistent, firm-but-friendly template with the correct amount.
4. **Draft in Gmail** — Creates a draft for your review before anything client-facing sends.

## What you approve

Sending the payment reminder to the client.', '{"version":1,"steps":[{"kind":"fetch","tool":"STRIPE_LIST_INVOICES","params":{"status":"open"},"bind":"invoice"},{"kind":"guard","path":"invoice.days_overdue","op":"gte","value":7},{"kind":"render","template":"Hi {{run.recipient_label}},\n\nJust a friendly reminder that invoice {{invoice.number}} for {{invoice.amount_label}} was due {{invoice.due_label}}. Let me know if you have any questions.\n\nThank you!","bind":"body"},{"kind":"act","tool":"GMAIL_CREATE_EMAIL_DRAFT","params":{"body":"{{body}}","subject":"Reminder: Invoice {{invoice.number}}"}}],"value":{"kind":"invoice_collected","currency":"USD","fromGap":true}}'::jsonb, ARRAY['GMAIL_CREATE_EMAIL_DRAFT'], '{"kind":"invoice_collected","currency":"USD","fromGap":true}'::jsonb, 1, 'active'),
  ('quiet-lead-nudge', 'Quiet Lead Nudge', 'follow-up', 'Revive a quiet lead with a personalized follow-up draft when a thread has gone stale.', 'Use when a person has gone silent after a promised next step or open thread.
Proactively suggest when Capture shows no response for 14+ days.', '{"type":"pattern","signal":"no_response","min_days_since_contact":14}'::jsonb, '# Quiet Lead Nudge

## What this does

Checks how long it has been since the last reply, then drafts a warm follow-up in Gmail for your review. Salt never sends without approval.

## When it runs

- A lead or client has not replied in 14+ days
- Capture or Follow-up Player flags a stalled conversation

## Steps

1. **Read the thread** — Salt pulls recent Gmail context so the draft references real history.
2. **Check staleness** — If the thread is still active, skip quietly (no nagging).
3. **Personalize** — Salt adjusts tone and specifics from thread context and your Memory.
4. **Draft in Gmail** — Creates a draft you can edit and send when ready.

## What you approve

Sending the follow-up email (draft is saved automatically; send stays with you).', '{"version":1,"steps":[{"kind":"fetch","tool":"GMAIL_FETCH_EMAILS","params":{"max_results":5},"bind":"thread"},{"kind":"guard","path":"thread.days_since_reply","op":"gte","value":14},{"kind":"llm","purpose":"personalize_follow_up","modelSlot":"playPersonalize","instructions":"Write a concise, warm follow-up referencing the last open topic. No guilt trips.","inputs":["run.recipient_label","thread.subject"],"maxTokens":300,"bind":"body"},{"kind":"act","tool":"GMAIL_CREATE_EMAIL_DRAFT","params":{"body":"{{body}}","subject":"Re: {{thread.subject}}"}}],"value":{"kind":"gap_closed","currency":"USD","fromGap":true}}'::jsonb, ARRAY['GMAIL_CREATE_EMAIL_DRAFT'], '{"kind":"gap_closed","currency":"USD","fromGap":true}'::jsonb, 1, 'active')
